      "predicate": "HAS_OMBUDSMAN_SUMMARY",
      "value": "We will not investigate this complaint about an alledged failure by the Council to give the complainant greater priority for housing on medical grounds. The complainant says her current property is unsuitable for her son’s medical needs. The Council considered the complainant's request having due regard to the complainant’s reasoning, along with medical evidence and advice it obtained. There is insufficient evidence of fault in the way the Council assessed the complainant’s medical priority request.",
